<title>MEXICO: LA MODERNA APPROVES INCREASE IN CAPITAL.</title>
<headline>LA MODERNA APPROVES INCREASE IN CAPITAL.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Empresas La Moderna SA agreed on Thursday to boost its capital by 100 percent, a company director said in an interview.</p>
<p>Enrique Osorio, La Moderna's treasury director, told Reuters that the increase would allow B.A.T Industries Plc to buy 50 percent of the Mexican conglomerate's cigarette unit, plus two shares.</p>
